import '../models/learning_models.dart';

const List<GeoTopic> orgsTopics = <GeoTopic>[
  GeoTopic(
    id: "organizations",
    title: "Aalami Tanzeemain",
    subtitle: "Tanzeemain aur Muahide. Duniya ke mulk mil kar kese kaam karte hain",
    portion: "orgs",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.heading("Ye hissa kyun zaroori hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("One paper me GK ke hisse me har saal tanzeemon par sawal ata hai. Kabhi pooch liya jata hai ke UNO ka headquarter kahan hai, kabhi IMF kab bani, kabhi Security Council ke mustaqil members kitne hain. Ye sawal mushkil nahi hote, bas facts boht sare hain aur student unhe aapas me mila deta hai. Geneva, New York, Washington aur Paris, ye chaar sheher har dusri tanzeem ke sath jure hue hain, aur paper hamesha yahin phansata hai. Is lesson me hum har tanzeem ko is tarah parhen ge ke pehle asaan matlab samajh aye ke ye tanzeem hai kis liye, phir us ke fix facts zehen me beth jayen, aur aakhir me wo trap bhi pata chal jaye jo paper lagata hai. Jo student ye tartib pakar le, wo tanzeemon wale sawal kabhi ghalat nahi karega."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Tanzeem hoti kya hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pehle ye samajh lo ke tanzeem hai kya. Jab kuch mulk mil kar kisi aik kaam ke liye aik idara bana lein, usay tanzeem kehte hain. Bilkul wese hi jese mohallay ke log mil kar anjuman bana lete hain ke gali ki safai aur pani ka masla sab mil kar hal karenge. Aik mulk akela apne maslay hal kar sakta hai, lekin kuch maslay aisay hote hain jo poori duniya ke hote hain. Jang rukwana, bemari khatam karna, ghareeb mulkon ko qarz dena, tijarat ke qawaaid banana, ye kaam koi aik mulk akela nahi kar sakta. Isi liye mulkon ne mil kar ye bare idaray banaye hain. Har tanzeem ka aik headquarter hota hai jahan us ka daftar hota hai, aik buniyad ki tareekh hoti hai, aur kuch member mulk hote hain. Paper bas yehi teen cheezain ghuma phira kar poochta hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("UNO. Duniya ki sab se bari tanzeem"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab sab se bari tanzeem se shuru karte hain, United Nations, jisay short me UN ya UNO kehte hain. Urdu me isay Aqwam-e-Muttahida kehte hain. Ye 1945 me bani. Wajah suno, dusri jang-e-azeem me karoron log mare gaye, sheher ke sheher tabah ho gaye. Jang khatam hui to duniya ke mulkon ne socha ke aisa idara banna chahiye jo ainda jangain rok sake aur mulkon ke jhagre baat cheet se hal hon. America ke sheher San Francisco me 50 mulkon ne mil kar is ke charter, yani is ke buniyadi qanoon, par dastakhat kiye. Phir 24 October 1945 ko ye tanzeem baqaida amal me a gayi. Isi liye har saal 24 October ko UN Day manaya jata hai. Paper me aksar poocha jata hai ke UNO kab amal me ayi, aur jawab 24 October 1945 hai, sirf 1945 likhna kaafi nahi hota jab options me tareekh di gayi ho."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is ka headquarter America ke sheher New York me hai. Is waqt is ke 193 member mulk hain, yani taqreeban poori duniya. Pakistan 30 September 1947 ko is ka member bana, yani azadi ke dedh mah baad. Ye tareekh bhi paper me ati hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("UNO ke chhe aham hisse"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("UNO aik bari imarat ki tarah hai jis ke chhe aham hisse hain. Har hisse ka kaam alag hai, aur paper inhi chhe ko ghuma kar poochta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pehla hissa General Assembly hai. Ye sab se bari majlis hai. Is me tamam 193 member mulk bethte hain aur har mulk ka sirf aik vote hota hai. America jesa bara mulk ho ya koi chhota sa jazira mulk, vote dono ka aik hi hai. Yehi is ki sab se khaas baat hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Dusra hissa Security Council hai, aur suno, ye poore UNO ka sab se taqatwar hissa hai. Is me kul 15 members hote hain. In me se 5 mustaqil, yani permanent members hain, aur 10 ghair mustaqil hote hain jo do saal ke liye chune jate hain. Mustaqil paanch ye hain: America, Russia, China, France aur Britain. In paanchon ke paas aik khaas taqat hai jisay veto power kehte hain. Veto ka matlab hai rok dena. Agar koi faisla ho raha ho aur in paanchon me se aik bhi na kar de, to faisla ruk jata hai, chahe baqi 14 members haan keh dein. Paper ki jaan yehi sawal hai, veto wale paanch mulk konse hain aur veto ka matlab kya hai. Aik aur baat, Security Council hi woh hissa hai jis ke faislay manna har member ke liye lazmi hota hai, aur yehi jang rukwane ke liye aman foj, yani peacekeeping force, bhejta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Teesra hissa Secretariat hai. Ye UNO ka daftar hai jahan roz ka kaam hota hai, files chalti hain, meetings hoti hain. Is ke sarbarah ko Secretary General kehte hain, jo poori tanzeem ka sab se bara ohda hai. Is waqt Secretary General Antonio Guterres hain, jo Portugal ke hain. Secretary General paanch saal ke liye chuna jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Chautha hissa International Court of Justice hai, yani Aalami Adalat-e-Insaaf. Yahan mulkon ke darmiyan jhagre sunay jate hain. Ab wo baat jo paper har dafa poochta hai aur aadhe students ghalat karte hain. Ye adalat New York me nahi hai. Ye Netherlands ke sheher The Hague me hai. UNO ke saare hisse New York me hain siwa is adalat ke. Ye aik line apne zehen me pathar par likh lo, International Court of Justice, The Hague, Netherlands."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paanchwa hissa ECOSOC hai, jis ka poora naam Economic and Social Council hai. Ye duniya ke maashi aur samaji maslon par kaam karta hai, ghareebi, taleem, sehat jese mamlaat."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Chhetha hissa Trusteeship Council hai. Ye un ilaqon ki dekh bhaal ke liye bana tha jo kisi mulk ke qabze se nikal kar UNO ke hawale hue the. Ab us ka kaam taqreeban khatam ho chuka hai, lekin chhe hison ki list me is ka naam ata hai, is liye yaad rakho."),
      LessonBlock.heading("UNO ke mashhoor idaray"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("UNO ke neeche kuch khaas idaray kaam karte hain, har aik aik hi kaam ka mahir hai. In ke headquarter alag alag shehron me hain, aur paper inhi shehron me phansata hai, is liye har idare ke sath us ka sheher bhi yaad karo."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("WHO, World Health Organization, sehat ki tanzeem hai. Urdu me isay Aalami Idara-e-Sehat kehte hain. Ye 1948 me bani aur is ka headquarter Geneva, Switzerland me hai. Duniya bhar ki bemarion se larna, vaccine ke programs chalana, ye is ka kaam hai. Corona ke dino me tum ne is ka naam har khabar me suna tha."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("UNESCO taleem, science aur saqafat ki tanzeem hai. Ye 1945 me bani aur is ka headquarter Paris, France me hai. Jo jagahain duniya ki virsa, yani World Heritage, kahlati hain, un ki list yehi tanzeem banati hai. Mohenjo Daro aur Taxila Pakistan me UNESCO ki list me shamil hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("UNICEF bachon ke liye kaam karta hai. Ye 1946 me bana. Bachon ki sehat, taleem aur khurak is ka kaam hai. Polio ke qatray pilane wali teams ka naam tum ne UNICEF ke sath suna hoga."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("FAO khurak aur ziraat ki tanzeem hai. Is ka headquarter Rome, Italy me hai. Duniya me bhook khatam karna aur kheeti bari ko behtar karna is ka kaam hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("ILO mazdooron ki tanzeem hai. Ye sab se purani idaron me se hai aur Geneva me hai. Mazdooron ke huqooq, kaam ke ghante, mazdoori ke qawaaid, ye is ka kaam hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("UNHCR mahajireen, yani refugees, ke liye kaam karta hai. Jo log jang ya zulm ki wajah se apna mulk chor kar dusre mulk chale jate hain, un ki madad ye idara karta hai. Pakistan me Afghan mahajireen ke mamle me is ka naam ata rehta hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("IMF. Paison wali tanzeem"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab us tanzeem ki baat jis ka naam Pakistan me har dusre din khabron me ata hai, IMF, International Monetary Fund. Is ka asaan matlab samjho. Jab kisi mulk ke paas dollars khatam ho jayen, wo cheezain bahir se na khareed sake, to wo IMF ke paas jata hai. IMF usay qarz deta hai aur sath maashi mashware bhi deta hai ke kharche kese kam karo, tax kese barhao. Bilkul wese hi jese koi shakhs mushkil waqt me bank se qarz leta hai aur bank shartein lagata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("IMF ka faisla 1944 me America ki aik jagah Bretton Woods me hone wali conference me hua, aur 1945 me ye baqaida amal me aya. Is ka headquarter Washington DC, America me hai. Is waqt is ke 190 members hain. Is ki aik khaas currency bhi hai jisay SDR kehte hain, Special Drawing Rights. Ye koi asli note nahi hota, bas IMF ke hisaab kitab ki ikai hai. Paper me SDR ka poora naam aur IMF ka headquarter boht ata hai. Pakistan kai dafa IMF ke programs le chuka hai, aur har program ke sath qarz ki qistain aur shartein jurri hoti hain. IMF aur World Bank dono Washington me hain aur dono 1944 ki Bretton Woods conference se jure hain, is liye in dono ko judwa idaray bhi kaha jata hai. Ye jor paper ka pasandida trap hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("World Bank"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("World Bank bhi 1944 me bana aur is ka headquarter bhi Washington DC me hai. Ab IMF aur World Bank ka farq saaf kar lo, kyunke paper yahin confuse karta hai. IMF chhoti muddat ke liye qarz deta hai jab mulk ki tijarat ka hisaab bigar jaye, yani fori mushkil door karne ke liye. World Bank lambi muddat ke liye qarz deta hai, taraqqi ke kaamon ke liye, jese dam banana, sadak banana, school aur hospital banana. World Bank ka sab se mashhoor hissa IBRD hai. To yaad rakho, fori maashi mushkil, IMF. Lamba taraqqiyati kaam, World Bank."),
      LessonBlock.heading("WTO. Tijarat ke qawaaid wali tanzeem"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("WTO, World Trade Organization, aalmi tijarat ki tanzeem hai. Ye 1995 me bani aur is ka headquarter Geneva me hai. Is ka kaam hai mulkon ke darmiyan tijarat ke qawaaid banana aur tijarati jhagre hal karna, taake aik mulk dusre ki cheezon par bila wajah pabandi ya zyada tax na laga sake. Is se pehle yehi kaam GATT nam ke muahide ke tehat hota tha jo 1948 se chala araha tha. WTO ne GATT ki jagah li hai. Paper me ye sawal ata hai ke WTO ne kis ki jagah li, jawab hai GATT."),
      LessonBlock.heading("NATO. Fouji ittehad"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("NATO aik fouji ittehad hai. Ye 1949 me bana aur is ka headquarter Brussels, Belgium me hai. Is waqt is ke 32 member mulk hain, jin me America, Britain, France, Germany aur Turkiye shamil hain. Is ki sab se mashhoor shart Article 5 hai. Is ka matlab hai ke agar kisi aik member mulk par hamla ho, to wo hamla tamam members par hamla samjha jayega, aur sab mil kar us ki madad karenge. Paper me NATO ka headquarter aur Article 5 boht poocha jata hai. Ye tanzeem UNO se alag hai, ye sirf fouji muahida hai, is ka UNO se koi lena dena nahi."),
      LessonBlock.heading("OIC. Musalman mulkon ki tanzeem"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("OIC, Organization of Islamic Cooperation, musalman mulkon ki tanzeem hai. Ye 1969 me bani. Is ki buniyad ki wajah aik dukh bhara waqia tha. 1969 me Masjid-e-Aqsa ko aag lagayi gayi, jis ke baad musalman mulkon ne mehsoos kiya ke un ka aik mushtarka idara hona chahiye. Is ki pehli summit Morocco ke sheher Rabat me hui. Is ka headquarter Saudi Arab ke sheher Jeddah me hai. Is waqt is ke 57 members hain. Ye UNO ke baad duniya ki dusri sab se bari tanzeem hai. Paper me OIC ki buniyad ka saal 1969, headquarter Jeddah, aur members 57, ye teenon facts bar bar ate hain. Pakistan is ka buniyadi member hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("SAARC. Apne ilaqay ki tanzeem"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("SAARC, South Asian Association for Regional Cooperation, hamare apne ilaqay, yani South Asia, ke mulkon ki tanzeem hai. Ye 1985 me Bangladesh ke sheher Dhaka me bani. Is ke kul 8 members hain: Pakistan, India, Bangladesh, Sri Lanka, Nepal, Bhutan, Maldives aur Afghanistan. Is ka headquarter Nepal ke sheher Kathmandu me hai. Paper me SAARC ke members ki tadaad 8 aur headquarter Kathmandu boht ata hai. Aik bareek baat yaad rakho, Afghanistan 2007 me shamil hua tha, us se pehle members 7 the. Purani kitabon me 7 likha mil sakta hai, lekin sahi jawab is waqt 8 hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("ASEAN"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("ASEAN South East Asia ke mulkon ki tanzeem hai. Ye 1967 me bani aur is ka headquarter Indonesia ke sheher Jakarta me hai. Malaysia, Indonesia, Thailand, Singapore aur Philippines is ke mashhoor members hain. Ye ilaqa tijarat me boht tez taraqqi kar raha hai, is liye is tanzeem ka naam khabron me ata rehta hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("SCO. Shanghai wali tanzeem"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("SCO, Shanghai Cooperation Organization, China aur Russia ki sarbarahi me bani hui tanzeem hai. Is ka headquarter China ke sheher Beijing me hai. Pakistan 2017 me is ka mustaqil, yani permanent member bana. India bhi usi saal member bana. Paper me ye sawal boht ata hai ke Pakistan SCO ka mustaqil member kab bana, jawab hai 2017."),
      LessonBlock.heading("EU. Europe ki tanzeem"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("EU, European Union, Europe ke mulkon ki tanzeem hai. Is ke members ne mil kar aik hi currency apna li hai jisay euro kehte hain, aur aik dusre ke mulkon me baghair visa ke ana jana asan hai. Is ka markaz Brussels, Belgium me hai. Britain 2020 me is se nikal gaya tha, is waqie ko Brexit kehte hain. Ye lafz paper me ata hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Commonwealth"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Commonwealth un mulkon ki tanzeem hai jo kabhi Britain ke qabze me rahe the. Pakistan azadi ke baad is ka member tha, phir 1972 me is se nikal gaya, aur 1989 me dobara shamil ho gaya. Paper me yehi sawal ata hai ke Pakistan Commonwealth me wapas kab shamil hua, jawab hai 1989."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Red Cross aur Red Crescent"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aakhir me aik aisi tanzeem jo na hukumat hai na mulkon ki majlis, Red Cross. Ye 1863 me Geneva me bani. Is ke bani Henry Dunant the. Is ka kaam hai jang aur afat me zakhmion aur musibat zadon ki madad karna, baghair kisi farq ke. Musalman mulkon me isay Red Crescent kehte hain, Urdu me Hilal-e-Ahmer. Pakistan ki Hilal-e-Ahmer bhi yehi kaam karti hai. Paper me Henry Dunant ka naam aur 1863 ka saal ata hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Fix facts ki recap"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab aakhir me wo facts aik saath dohra lo jo paper me sab se zyada ate hain. UNO 24 October 1945 ko amal me ayi, headquarter New York, members 193. Security Council ke kul 15 members, 5 mustaqil jin ke paas veto hai: America, Russia, China, France, Britain. International Court of Justice The Hague, Netherlands me hai, New York me nahi. WHO Geneva, UNESCO Paris, FAO Rome. IMF aur World Bank dono Washington me aur dono 1944 ki Bretton Woods conference se jure. IMF ke members 190, us ki khaas currency SDR hai. WTO 1995 me bani, GATT ki jagah li, headquarter Geneva. NATO 1949, headquarter Brussels, members 32, mashhoor shart Article 5. OIC 1969, headquarter Jeddah, members 57. SAARC 1985, headquarter Kathmandu, members 8. Pakistan SCO ka mustaqil member 2017 me bana. Pakistan Commonwealth me wapas 1989 me shamil hua. Red Cross 1863 me bani, bani Henry Dunant."),
    ],
  ),
  GeoTopic(
    id: "treaties",
    title: "Mashhoor Muahide aur Agreements",
    subtitle: "Muahide aur Agreements. Jab mulk kagaz par waada karte hain",
    portion: "orgs",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.heading("Ye hissa kyun zaroori hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Tanzeemon ke sath sath one paper me muahidon par bhi har saal sawal ata hai. Indus Waters Treaty kab hua, Simla Agreement me kya tay hua, Tashkent me kon saalis tha, ye sawal ghuma phira kar ate rehte hain. Muahidon ka mushkil hissa ye hai ke in ke naam, saal aur jagah aapas me mil jate hain. Karachi, Tashkent, Simla, Lahore, ye sheher aur 1960, 1966, 1972, 1999, ye saal student ke zehen me garbar ho jate hain. Is lesson me har muahide ko aik kahani ki tarah parhen ge: pehle ye ke jhagra kya tha, phir muahida kab aur kahan hua, phir us me tay kya hua, aur aakhir me wo baat jo paper poochta hai. Kahani yaad reh jati hai, sirf tareekh ratni nahi parti."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Muahida hota kya hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pehle lafz saaf kar lo. Jab do ya zyada mulk kisi maslay par baith kar baat karte hain aur phir kagaz par likh kar dastakhat kar dete hain ke hum is baat ke paband hain, us kagaz ko muahida kehte hain. English me isay treaty kehte hain. Agreement bhi taqreeban yehi cheez hai, aam tor par agreement muahide se halka aur chhota samjha jata hai, lekin paper me dono lafz aik hi maane me ate hain. Jab koi muahida sirf ailan ki surat me ho, dastakhaton ke sath lekin qanooni pabandi halki ho, to usay declaration kehte hain, jese Tashkent Declaration aur Lahore Declaration. Ye bareek farq zehen me rakho, paper kabhi kabhi naam par hi phansa deta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aik aur baat. Jab do mulkon ke darmiyan koi teesra mulk ya idara beech me par kar sulah karwaye, usay saalisi kehte hain, English me mediation. Kai muahidon me saalis ka naam paper ka fix sawal hota hai. Indus Waters Treaty me World Bank saalis tha, Tashkent me Soviet Union saalis tha. Ye joray khaas taur par yaad karna."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Indus Waters Treaty 1960. Daryaaon ki taqseem"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ye Pakistan ke liye sab se aham muahida hai aur paper me sab se zyada ata hai. Kahani ye hai. Azadi ke waqt Punjab ke darya dono mulkon me bat gaye. Daryaaon ke headworks, yani jahan se nahrain nikalti hain, un me se kuch India me reh gaye aur khet Pakistan me. 1948 me India ne Pakistan ki taraf ane wala pani rok diya, nahrain sookh gayin, faslain tabah hone lagin. Ye masla barhta gaya. Phir World Bank beech me aya aur nau saal ki lambi baat cheet ke baad 19 September 1960 ko Karachi me muahida hua. Pakistan ki taraf se President Ayub Khan ne aur India ki taraf se Prime Minister Jawaharlal Nehru ne dastakhat kiye. World Bank ne bhi is par dastakhat kiye kyunke wo saalis tha."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab wo baat jo is muahide ki jaan hai aur paper har dafa poochta hai, chhe daryaaon ki taqseem. Punjab ke chhe bare darya hain. Teen mashriqi darya India ko de diye gaye: Ravi, Beas aur Sutlej. In teenon ke pani par India ka poora haq tay hua. Teen maghribi darya Pakistan ko mile: Indus, yani Darya-e-Sindh, Jhelum aur Chenab. In teenon ka pani Pakistan ka haq tay hua, bas India ko in par mehdood istemal ki ijazat mili, jese bijli banana waghera, lekin pani rokna ya rukawat dalna mana hai. Is taqseem ko yaad karne ka asaan tareeqa ye hai ke naqshe par dekho, jo teen darya mashriq ki taraf hain wo India ke, jo teen maghrib ki taraf hain wo Pakistan ke. Maghribi teenon me Indus sab se bara hai, isiliye muahide ka naam hi Indus Waters Treaty para. Paper me aksar options me Chenab ko India ki taraf aur Ravi ko Pakistan ki taraf likh kar phansaya jata hai, is liye ye taqseem pathar par likh lo: mashriqi teen Ravi, Beas, Sutlej India ke; maghribi teen Indus, Jhelum, Chenab Pakistan ke."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Tashkent Declaration 1966. Jang ke baad sulah"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("1965 me Pakistan aur India ke darmiyan bari jang hui. Jang band hui to sulah ki baat cheet ke liye dono mulk Soviet Union ke sheher Tashkent me ikatthe hue. January 1966 me muahida hua jisay Tashkent Declaration kehte hain. Pakistan ki taraf se President Ayub Khan aur India ki taraf se Prime Minister Lal Bahadur Shastri sharik hue. Saalis Soviet Union ke Prime Minister Alexei Kosygin the. Ye saalis wala sawal paper ka fix sawal hai. Muahide me tay hua ke dono mulkon ki fojain wapas un jagahon par chali jayengi jahan jang se pehle thi, aur maslay baat cheet se hal honge."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is muahide ke sath aik mashhoor aur dukh bhara waqia jura hai. Muahide ke agle hi din, 11 January 1966 ko, Lal Bahadur Shastri ka Tashkent me hi achanak inteqal ho gaya. Paper me ye bhi poocha jata hai ke Shastri ki wafat kahan hui, jawab hai Tashkent."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Simla Agreement 1972. LoC ka naam kese para"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("1971 ki jang ke baad 2 July 1972 ko India ke sheher Simla me muahida hua. Pakistan ki taraf se President Zulfikar Ali Bhutto aur India ki taraf se Prime Minister Indira Gandhi ne dastakhat kiye. Is muahide ki do baatein paper ki jaan hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pehli baat, Kashmir me jo purani ceasefire line thi, us ka naam badal kar Line of Control, yani LoC, rakh diya gaya. Yaad rakho, LoC koi sarhad nahi hai, ye sirf woh lakeer hai jahan dono fojain ruki hui hain. Paper me aksar poocha jata hai ke ceasefire line ko LoC ka naam kis muahide me mila, jawab hai Simla Agreement 1972."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Dusri baat, dono mulkon ne tay kiya ke apne tamam maslay, bashamool Kashmir, do-tarfa baat cheet se hal karenge, yani kisi teesre ko beech me nahi layenge. Ye do-tarfa wali shart is muahide ki pehchan hai. Jang bandi ke qaidi bhi is ke baad wapas hue."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Lahore Declaration 1999. Bus wala safar"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("February 1999 me India ke Prime Minister Atal Bihari Vajpayee bus par sawaar ho kar Lahore aye. Ye aik tareekhi safar tha, jisay bus diplomacy bhi kehte hain. Lahore me un ka istaqbal Prime Minister Nawaz Sharif ne kiya aur dono ne Lahore Declaration par dastakhat kiye. Is me tay hua ke dono mulk aman se rahenge, Kashmir samait tamam maslay baat cheet se hal karenge aur atom bomb ki jang ka khatra kam karne ke liye aitemaad barhaya jayega. Isi safar me Vajpayee Minar-e-Pakistan bhi gaye the, ye baat bhi paper me ati hai. Afsos ke kuch maah baad Kargil ki jang ho gayi aur ye amal ruk gaya, lekin muahida apni jagah tareekh ka hissa hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Geneva Conventions 1949. Jang ke bhi qawaaid hain"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ye muahida mulkon ke darmiyan sarhad ka nahi, jang ke doran insani rawaiye ka hai. 1949 me Switzerland ke sheher Geneva me ye conventions bane. In me tay hua ke jang ke doran zakhmion ka ilaaj hoga, jo sipahi hathyar dal de ya girftar ho jaye us ke sath acha salook hoga, usay mara nahi jayega, aam shehrion ko nishana nahi banaya jayega. Qaidi ke huqooq inhi conventions me likhe hain. Red Cross ka idara inhi qawaaid ki nigrani se jura hai. Paper me aksar poocha jata hai ke jang ke qaidi ke huqooq kis muahide me hain, jawab hai Geneva Conventions 1949."),
      LessonBlock.heading("NPT 1968. Atom bomb na phailane ka muahida"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("NPT ka poora naam Nuclear Non-Proliferation Treaty hai. Ye 1968 me bana. Is ka maqsad tha ke atom bomb mazeed mulkon tak na phailay, jin paanch mulkon ke paas pehle se hai bas unhi tak rahe. Duniya ke zyada tar mulkon ne is par dastakhat kar diye. Pakistan ne is par dastakhat nahi kiye. Wajah ghair-janibdarana tor par ye hai ke Pakistan ka maanna hai ke ye muahida ghair munsefana hai, kyunke ye kuch mulkon ko atom bomb rakhne ki ijazat deta hai aur baqion ko rokta hai, aur Pakistan apni hifazat ke paish-e-nazar is pabandi ko us waqt tak qubool nahi karta jab tak ilaqa is se pak na ho. India ne bhi is par dastakhat nahi kiye. Paper me ye sawal ata hai ke Pakistan ne NPT par dastakhat kyun nahi kiye, aur ye bhi ke NPT kab bana, 1968."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Paris Agreement 2015. Mausam ka muahida"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ye muahida kisi jang ya sarhad ka nahi, poori duniya ke mausam ka hai. December 2015 me France ke sheher Paris me duniya ke taqreeban tamam mulk ikatthe hue aur tay kiya ke duniya ka darja hararat barhne se rokenge, factoryon aur gariyon ka dhuan kam karenge, warna garmi, sailaab aur khushk saali poori duniya ko nuqsan pohchayegi. Pakistan bhi is ka hissa hai. Paper me Paris Agreement ka saal 2015 aur maqsad mausamiyati tabdeeli, yani climate change, poocha jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Durand Line Agreement 1893. Sab se purana muahida"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ye is list ka sab se purana muahida hai. 1893 me British India aur Afghanistan ke darmiyan ye muahida hua. Afghanistan ki taraf se Ameer Abdur Rahman Khan the aur British ki taraf se Sir Mortimer Durand, jin ke naam par is lakeer ko Durand Line kehte hain. Yehi lakeer aaj Pakistan aur Afghanistan ki sarhad hai. Is ki poori tafseel borders wale portion me di gayi hai, yahan bas ye yaad rakho ke Durand Line koi muahida nahi jo aaj kal hua ho, ye 1893 ki baat hai aur ye angrezon ke dor ki sarhad hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("CPEC 2015. China ke sath maashi raahdari"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("CPEC ka poora naam China Pakistan Economic Corridor hai. Ye 2015 me shuru hua. Ye aik muahide se barh kar bare maashi mansubon ka majmua hai. China ke sheher Kashgar se lekar Pakistan ke Gwadar tak sadkon, railway aur bijli ke mansubon ka jaal bichaya gaya, taake China ko samandar tak seedha rasta mile aur Pakistan me bijli, sadak aur rozgar barhe. Gwadar is ka dil hai. Paper me CPEC ka aaghaz 2015, Kashgar se Gwadar tak ka rasta, aur is ka China ke bare One Belt One Road mansube ka hissa hona, ye baatein ati hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Treaty of Versailles 1919. Pehli jang ka ikhtitam"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ye muahida Pakistan se seedha nahi jurta, lekin one paper me duniya ki tareekh ke hisse me ata hai. 1919 me France ke sheher Versailles me ye muahida hua jis se pehli jang-e-azeem ka baqaida ikhtitam hua. Haar jane wale Germany par sakht shartein lagayi gayin, us ki foj chhoti kar di gayi, ilaqay cheen liye gaye aur bhari tazwana, yani jurmana, dala gaya. Tareekh parhne wale kehte hain ke inhi sakht sharton ki narazgi ne dusri jang-e-azeem ki buniyad rakhi. Paper me is ka saal 1919 aur Germany ke sath hona poocha jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Camp David 1978. Misr aur Israel ki pehli sulah"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("1978 me America ke Camp David nam ke maqam par America ke President Jimmy Carter ne Misr aur Israel ko bithaya. Misr ki taraf se President Anwar Sadat aur Israel ki taraf se Prime Minister Menachem Begin the. Is mulaqat ke natije me 1979 me Misr aur Israel ke darmiyan baqaida sulah ka muahida hua. Misr wo pehla Arab mulk bana jis ne Israel ke sath sulah ki. Paper me Camp David ka saal 1978, saalis America, aur Misr ka pehla Arab mulk hona, ye baatein ati hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Fix facts ki recap"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab aakhir me har muahide ki aik aik line zehen me bandh lo. Indus Waters Treaty 1960, Karachi, Ayub Khan aur Nehru, saalis World Bank, mashriqi teen darya Ravi, Beas, Sutlej India ko, maghribi teen Indus, Jhelum, Chenab Pakistan ko. Tashkent Declaration 1966, saalis Soviet PM Kosygin, Shastri ki wafat bhi Tashkent me. Simla Agreement 1972, Bhutto aur Indira Gandhi, ceasefire line ka naam LoC hua, maslay do-tarfa hal karne ki shart. Lahore Declaration 1999, Vajpayee bus par Lahore aye. Geneva Conventions 1949, jang ke qaidi aur zakhmion ke huqooq. NPT 1968, atom bomb na phailane ka muahida, Pakistan ne dastakhat nahi kiye. Paris Agreement 2015, mausamiyati tabdeeli. Durand Line 1893, Ameer Abdur Rahman aur Sir Mortimer Durand. CPEC 2015, Kashgar se Gwadar. Treaty of Versailles 1919, pehli jang ka ikhtitam, Germany par sakht shartein. Camp David 1978, America ki saalisi me Misr aur Israel ki sulah ki buniyad."),
    ],
  ),
];
